      "title": "TypeScript Claude SDK tool writes to the filesystem",
      "explanation": "This TypeScript Claude SDK tool writes to the filesystem. If the path or contents derive from tool arguments, a prompt-injected agent can overwrite arbitrary files reachable by the host process. (This is a coarse signal — it flags any filesystem write, not only unnormalized paths, because TS path-normalization analysis is not yet wired.)\n",
